{"parse": {"title": "1987宇宙组曲(物品)", "pageid": 100331, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"1987宇宙组曲\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9e/Item-221171.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"1987宇宙组曲\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>1987宇宙组曲</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#221171</div></div><hr /><div>收录了一段回忆的磁记录媒介。《1987宇宙组曲》已经添加至氛围制造机。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">漆黑之中的色彩，远隔千里的触感，无须入口便可品味的芬芳皆在此处。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">氛围制造机</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><div><img alt=\"Bgmtoggle infoicon.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/20px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"image-negative\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/30px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bd/Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png/40px-Bgmtoggle_infoicon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" />介绍：现在，感受这一切的一切，直到自我消失。<br /><img alt=\"Bgmtoggle chaticon.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/20px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"image-negative\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/30px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png/40px-Bgmtoggle_chaticon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /><span class=\"item-link\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E4%B9%8B%E7%9C%BC\" title=\"星之眼\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E4%B9%8B%E7%9C%BC\" title=\"星之眼\"><img alt=\"星之眼\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-303401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-303401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E4%B9%8B%E7%9C%BC\" title=\"星之眼\">星之眼</a></span></span>的评论：坚持每天对一颗星星发射光波，再大喊：“你好！我在这里！”这样你的寂寞就会消失，真的。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "1987宇宙组曲"}}